      "createNonce": {
        "details": "Creates started so far, per Safe and role. A counter, not a      nonce that a caller can choose: `create*Module` takes the next      value and increments it once the deployment has succeeded."
      },
      "draftsModules": {
        "details": "Proxies this factory created, per Safe — **an index, not proof**.      Creation is permissionless, so anyone can push an entry for any Safe      here; read it only against the Safe's own adoption record."
      },
      "guards": {
        "details": "The guard this factory deployed for a history proxy, or      `address(0)`. An index again: it says what was deployed, not what      the Safe installed."
      }
